                        <div data-card-id="1" data-calc-height data-card-status="active"
                            class="cards-slider__info-card is--relative">
                            <p class="card-slider__eyebrow">Problem Statement</p>
                            <h3 data-calc-height-target class="is--balance">Rural Mobility Left Behind.</h3>
                            <p>Many rural and underserved parts of Ghana lack access to mainstream mobility services.
                                Unregulated motorbike taxis, locally called Okada, create accidents, unclear prices, and
                                limit access to basic services, leaving communities isolated and economically stagnant.
                            </p>
                        </div>
                        <div data-card-id="2" data-calc-height data-card-status="not-active"
                            class="cards-slider__info-card">
                            <p class="card-slider__eyebrow">Our Solution</p>
                            <h3 data-calc-height-target>Building for People, not Cars</h3>
                            <p>ORDA Rides makes rural travel safe and reliable by partnering with okada riders and local
                                businesses. Verified profiles, safety training, and clear pricing build trust and turn
                                informal work into dignified livelihoods.</p>
                        </div>
                        <div data-card-id="3" data-calc-height data-card-status="not-active"
                            class="cards-slider__info-card">
                            <p class="card-slider__eyebrow">Our Vision</p>
                            <h3 data-calc-height-target>Bringing Rural Ghana Onboard
                            </h3>
                            <p>We envision a Ghana where rural communities are fully included in the mobility economy.
                                ORDA RIDES exists to make safe, reliable, and dignified transportation accessible to
                                every town, no matter how small.
                            </p>
                        </div>
                        <div data-card-id="4" data-calc-height data-card-status="not-active"
                            class="cards-slider__info-card">
                            <p class="card-slider__eyebrow">Our Impact</p>
                            <h3 data-calc-height-target>Change is already here.</h3>
                            <p>Since launching in our pilot community of Adeiso, Upper West Akim District - E/R, we have
                                onboarded over <b>250 users</b>, with <b>92+ active users</b> relying on the platform
                                for their daily needs everyday. By vetting and retraining over <b>20 riders</b>, we have
                                established a formal safety standard that is currently changing lives. <br> The future
                                is only brighter!</p>
                        </div>
